# The kitty keyboard protocol's legacy section, which decides each key
# while the flags in force hold neither flag 1 nor flag 8. Under flag 2
# this scenario presses keys only. The text keys i, 3 and ; follow the
# section's table of example encodings, and Ctrl with Shift, Super, or
# Ctrl, Alt and Shift together give CSI u. Ctrl maps the keys of the
# section's ctrl table, and leaves other ASCII keys as they are. Enter,
# Escape, Backspace, Tab and Space follow the section's table of C0
# controls, with Backspace's bytes swapped because vtium's Backspace
# sends 0x08. The functional keys drop Caps Lock and NumLock, and use
# SS3 in cursor key mode only when no modifier is held.
# spec: kitty's Comprehensive keyboard handling in terminals: Legacy key event encoding, Legacy functional keys, Legacy text keys, Legacy ctrl mapping of ASCII keys, Bugs in fixterms; ADR-1005 D6
# covers: input.kitty-keyboard
size 20 2
needs key-forms
send "\e[>2u"
key i
key I mods=shift
key i mods=alt
key i mods=ctrl
key I mods=shift+alt
key i mods=ctrl+alt
cmd key;sym=49;ascii=49;unicode=49;unshifted=69;base=69;mods=5
key 3 mods=ctrl
key 3 mods=ctrl+alt
cmd key;sym=23;ascii=23;unicode=23;unshifted=33;base=33;mods=1
cmd key;sym=23;ascii=23;unicode=23;unshifted=33;base=33;mods=9
cmd key;sym=23;ascii=23;unicode=23;unshifted=33;base=33;mods=5
key semicolon mods=ctrl
key semicolon mods=alt
cmd key;sym=3a;ascii=3a;unicode=3a;unshifted=3b;base=3b;mods=9
cmd key;sym=3a;ascii=3a;unicode=3a;unshifted=3b;base=3b;mods=5
key a mods=logo
key A mods=shift+ctrl+alt
key 2 mods=ctrl
key 4 mods=ctrl
key 5 mods=ctrl
key 6 mods=ctrl
key 7 mods=ctrl
key 8 mods=ctrl
key 9 mods=ctrl
key 0 mods=ctrl
key slash mods=ctrl
key bracketright mods=ctrl
key backslash mods=ctrl
key minus mods=ctrl
key equal mods=ctrl
key apostrophe mods=ctrl
key comma mods=ctrl
key period mods=ctrl
key grave mods=ctrl
key Return mods=ctrl
key Return mods=alt
key Return mods=logo
key Escape mods=ctrl
key Escape mods=alt
key Escape mods=logo
key BackSpace
key BackSpace mods=shift
key BackSpace mods=alt
key BackSpace mods=ctrl
key Tab mods=alt
key Tab mods=ctrl+alt
key ISO_Left_Tab mods=shift
key ISO_Left_Tab mods=shift+ctrl
key ISO_Left_Tab mods=shift+alt
key space mods=shift
key space mods=ctrl
key space mods=alt
key space mods=ctrl+alt
key Up mods=num
key Up mods=ctrl+num
key F5 mods=lock
key End
key F4
send "\e[?1h"
key Home
key Home mods=shift
key F1
key F1 mods=ctrl
key F3 mods=shift
